<title>SINGAPORE: Heshe division plans Hong Kong listing.</title>
<headline>Heshe division plans Hong Kong listing.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail and garment manufacturer Heshe Holdings Ltd said on Friday its North Asia division planned to seek a separate listing in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>The division comprises the company's business in Benefashion Hong Kong, Benefashion Taiwan and FUN Corporation China, a company statement said.</p>
<p>It did not provide any further details.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
